Third party material
--------------------

The data folder. Jettison ships with a second folder, Jettison_Data, and the add-on including that
folder falls under the terms above, with one exception: Jettison_Data/Facts.lua carries its own
licence line in its header. Where that file holds rows derived from the Classic Era tables (the
CMaNGOS lineage), it is distributed under the GNU General Public License, version 3.0, the same
standing as ItemTree's EraSources.lua; its header says which applies.

Blizzard's material. World of Warcraft, its spell, class and race names, the numbers behind
them, and any in-client texture path, atlas name or interface function this add-on refers to
belong to Blizzard Entertainment, Inc. Jettison ships no Blizzard artwork and claims no
ownership of Blizzard's data.
